      "quote": "In this work, we propose a novel, fast, and memory-efficient unsupervised statistical method, combined with an unsupervised deep learning (DL) model, for de-snowing 3D LiDAR point clouds in a fully unsupervised fashion.",
      "label": "无监督去雪问题定义",
      "quotes": [
        "In this work, we propose a novel, fast, and memory-efficient unsupervised statistical method, combined with an unsupervised deep learning (DL) model, for de-snowing 3D LiDAR point clouds in a fully unsupervised fashion.",
        "Our methodology has two stages. In the first stage, a new, simple, yet efficient statistical method named Statistical Snow Remover (SSR) is used to generate an initial estimate about potential outliers, i.e., snow particles, in the point cloud by considering the intensity and sparsity information."
      ],
