      "quotes": [
        "Adverse weather, particularly snow, poses a significant challenge to the development of autonomous vehicles, since the quality of sensor readings, such as 3D LiDAR point clouds, is degraded by the presence of snowflakes [1].",
        "The results obtained on the real-scanned Winter Adverse Driving dataSet (WADS) show that our DL model achieves a 6.3% improvement in mIoU over the current state-of-the-art unsupervised DL methods and performs comparable to supervised counterparts, substantially narrowing the performance gap between supervised and unsupervised approaches.",
        "In addition to that, our model also outperforms its closest competitor by 12.8% mIoU when tested on our Canadian Adverse Driving Conditions (CADC) dataset annotations."
      ],
